  "description": "\n      AmongUsPrefabs is a lightweight and efficient API designed for mod developers to easily load, retrieve, \n      and manipulate prefabs in Among Us. This API provides a streamlined way to work with in-game assets, \n      reducing the need for manual extraction and enhancing mod development speed. \n\n      Features:\n      - Automatically detects and loads prefabs from Among Us.\n      - Provides a caching system to avoid redundant asset lookups.\n      - Supports runtime modifications and prefab customization.\n      - Compatible with BepInEx IL2CPP for Among Us modding.\n\n      This package is ideal for modders looking to extend Among Us with custom objects, effects, \n      or interactable elements without requiring deep knowledge of the game's internal structure.\n    ",
